# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/subscription

## Purpose
Owns Android application handling for LumiNet subscription/configuration feeds and their lifecycle.

## Contents
Contains subscription models, update/import coordination, and Android-facing helpers for consuming configured feeds.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Receives remote or user-configured subscription data and connects it to application configuration and persistence contracts.

## Invariants
Remote content is untrusted until validated, failed refreshes must not destroy the last known-good state, and updates must preserve transactional configuration semantics.